.TH CORTEX 1 "2026-01-02" "cortex-cli" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
cortex \- schema-driven CLI for a Cortex knowledge base
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B cortex
[\-\-root ROOT] <command> [args...]
.SH DESCRIPTION
cortex manages a fixed-layout knowledge base ("Cortex") with a small schema file
.BR .cortex/schema.yml
that defines ID rules, metadata requirements, link parsing, and indexing policy.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B init ROOT --title TITLE
Create a new Cortex instance.
.TP
.B node
Manage nodes.
.TP
.B asset
Manage node assets.
.TP
.B index
Build/show derived indexes.
.TP
.B validate
Validate README + metadata against schema.
.SH SEE ALSO
Project README.
